<title>AUSTRALIA: Eagle Bay buys Gawler Craton acreage.</title>
<headline>Eagle Bay buys Gawler Craton acreage.</headline>
<dateline>ADELAIDE 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gold explorer Eagle Bay Resources NL said on Thursday that the South Australian Department of Mines and Energy has granted Eagle an exploration licence in the prospective Gawler Craton area of the state.</p>
<p>Eagle Bay said licence 446/96 covers 248 square kms and is located some 12 km north east of the Resolute Ltd /Equinox Resources NL Golf Bore discovery on an extension of the magnetically defined Golf Bore Shear system.</p>
<p>At 10.40 a.m. (2340 GMT), Eagle Bay shares were 2.5 cents up at 37.5 cents.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
